test_memquota_hook tests plan_memory_hook (src/include/cdb/memquota.h),
through which an extension says how many memory-intensive operators a plan
node counts as when the memory policy splits the statement's memory, and
whether it is blocking, which EAGER_FREE groups the operators by.

The module counts each Sort as test_memquota_hook.sort_ops operators, makes
a Hash Join's outer input blocking with test_memquota_hook.outer_blocking, and
reports the operatorMemKB the policy gave each node of the plan as the query
starts on the coordinator, which is where the memory is assigned.
